  dct:description "The Contracting Authority, wishes to put in place Framework Agreements with suitably qualified Consultants to act on behalf of the Contracting Authority in carrying out design services associated with building works at Cork and Dublin Airports, as described in the attached RFI documents, and other associated works as required by the Contracting Authority. The Contracting Authority wishes to put in place the following Framework Agreements: Lot 1: Minor Building Design Services (AFC up to €10m)."@en,
